# 行尾统一：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 上 rustfmt/prettier 与 CI 的判断不一致
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本按惯例保留 CRLF（PowerShell 对 LF 也能跑，但 diff/编辑器更习惯 CRLF）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要让 git 尝试做文本合并
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
